# LexaSafe Creative Dev

- Palette: `#FBF8F4` / `#84AFFB` / `#0259DD` / `#D91A2A`. Navbar + hero titles: Syne.
- Magnetic hover ONLY on `HeroRequisition` presentation cards — never on homepage navbar/hero CTAs.
- Keep `CreatorsSection` a Server Component. Do not add `"use client"` under `HomeShell`.
- No DPO email in footer. No `optimizePackageImports` on workspace packages. No immutable `/_next/static` homepage cache.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — ScrollTrigger in useEffect, no revert
useEffect(() => {
  gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);
  gsap.to(".x", { scrollTrigger: { trigger: ".x" } });
}, []);

// ✅ GOOD — useGSAP context auto-reverts (kills ScrollTriggers)
useGSAP(() => {
  gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);
  gsap.from(".poc-card", { y: 40, scrollTrigger: { trigger: ".poc-cards", start: "top 80%" } });
}, { scope: rootRef });
```

- Lenis: `lenis/react` (not deprecated `@studio-freight/react-lenis`). Single instance in `apps/web` root layout (`SmoothScroll`). Do not wrap `/` or `/poc` in a second Lenis. Homepage GSAP lives in `HomeScrollDirector` as a **sibling** of `HomeShell`, not nested under it. R3F: client + `dynamic(..., { ssr: false })`.
- AI keys server-only. `/setup` gets presence booleans only.
